DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42544::$$$message_0340_0000_0000$$$::"Shirou. This may be a foolish question, but what are onsen eggs supposed to be?"::
42545::$$$message_0340_0000_0001$$$::"They're eggs boiled in a literal onsen[line len=2]a hot spring bath. Not actual bathwater people use, of course."::
42546::$$$message_0340_0000_0002$$$::"...Does it taste good?"::
42547::$$$message_0340_0000_0003$$$::"Ah... [wait time=600][l][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=楽2 time=200][say storage=HSHI1_SHI_0030 _name=士郎]Well, there is a different...aura to them than regular boiled eggs."::
42548::$$$message_0340_0000_0004$$$::"I see. It's just boiling an egg, and yet...[l][hfsigh layer=0][say storage=HSHI1_SAV_0040 _name=セイバー] Your country's cuisine is quite profound."::
42549::$$$message_0340_0000_0005$$$::"...I get the feeling that cooking was a little rough in your day."::
42550::$$$message_0340_0000_0006$$$::"Shirou. If I may be frank, that topic is off-limits. If these were less peaceful times, a verbal apology would not be enough to make amends for broaching it."::
42551::$$$message_0340_0000_0007$$$::"Um... Even asking about boiled eggs?"::
42552::$$$message_0340_0000_0008$$$::"Yes. I would require a particularly fervent apology, in that case."::
42553::$$$message_0340_0000_0009$$$::"Huh. Well, it'll be a trip, but do you want to try onsen eggs?"::
42554::$$$message_0340_0000_0010$$$::"...Can we?"::
42555::$$$message_0340_0000_0011$$$::"Yeah. I can tell you're curious."::
42556::$$$message_0340_0000_0012$$$::"Y-[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=200][hfsigh layer=0][say storage=HSHI1_SAV_0100 _name=セイバー]yes, I am."::
42557::$$$message_0340_0000_0013$$$::"Cool. Then let's go."�)/q